        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Many voters who were potentially open to change in New York have moved away.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "If you had run for governor under current conditions, you likely would have won the election.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
